{
  "tema": 5152,
  "slug": "subjuntivo-presente-ser",
  "titulo": "Conjugate ser in the present subjunctive",
  "subtitulo": "It doesn't follow the other -er verbs. ¡Que seas feliz!",
  "foto": "t05.jpg",
  "regla": "Ser has the irregular stem se- with regular endings: sea, seas, sea, seamos, sean.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Ser** is irregular in the present subjunctive because **its stem is irregular**. It doesn't follow the same rule as other **-er** verbs: nothing comes out of **soy**. You learn it as it is."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "**se-**",
            "**-a, -as, -a, -amos, -an**"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "ser"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "sea"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "seas"
            ],
            [
              "él, ella, usted",
              "sea"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros",
              "seamos"
            ],
            [
              "ustedes, ellos",
              "sean"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **sea** looks like the English _sea_. The sea is what it is: it doesn't conjugate like the others."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "¡Que ==seas== feliz!",
              "en": "Be happy! / May you be happy!"
            },
            {
              "es": "No creo que eso ==sea== muy inteligente.",
              "en": "I don't think that's very smart."
            },
            {
              "es": "Puede que ==seamos== los únicos en el agua.",
              "en": "We may be the only ones in the water."
            },
            {
              "es": "No creo que ==sea== tan egoísta.",
              "en": "I don't think she's that selfish."
            },
            {
              "es": "Es probable que ==sean== capaces.",
              "en": "They're probably capable."
            },
            {
              "es": "No pienso que ==sean== justos.",
              "en": "I don't think they're fair."
            },
            {
              "es": "Espero que ==sean== responsables con la tabla.",
              "en": "I hope you're responsible with the board."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The triggers here are doubt (**no creo que**, **no pienso que**), probability (**es probable que**, [[7228|**puede que**]]) and wishes (**espero que**, **que…**)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Creo que** states what you think and takes the ordinary present. **No creo que** expresses doubt and takes the subjunctive."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Creo que es buena idea."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "No creo que sea buena idea."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "No creo que es buena idea."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "No creo que sea buena idea."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Espero que eres feliz."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Espero que seas feliz."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "usos",
      "titulo": "Sea in other places",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "usos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "forma": "No creo que sea fácil.",
              "texto": "After doubt, wishes or probability.",
              "aqui": true
            },
            {
              "forma": "No seas así.",
              "texto": "The negative **tú** command. See [[9255|negative commands]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "Sean puntuales.",
              "texto": "The **ustedes** command. See [[6961|commands for usted and ustedes]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "O sea…",
              "texto": "The everyday filler is **ser** in the subjunctive too. See [[7265|**o sea** and **es decir**]]."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "parientes",
      "titulo": "Related rules",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "usos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "forma": "soy, eres, es",
              "texto": "The ordinary present: [[5070|**ser** in the present]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "esté, estés",
              "texto": "Its partner: [[5229|**estar** in the subjunctive]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "vaya, vayas",
              "texto": "Another irregular stem: [[5231|**ir** in the subjunctive]]."
            },
            {
              "forma": "coma, viva",
              "texto": "Where the endings come from: [[5151|-er and -ir in the subjunctive]]."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "kwiz",
      "titulo": "Check yourself",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Say it out loud, then open the answer."
